Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:13.47,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,全国模拟考结果如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:14.50,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.93,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,341.615)\fs72\c&H1B1B1B&}全国模拟结果如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.93,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1336.89,709.918)\fs72\c&H1B1B1B&}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.93,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1471.999,1081.779)\fs72\c&H1B1B1B&}还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.09,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那当然是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:18.47,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,佐藤同学 我看到模拟考成绩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:19.72,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:21.31,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,嘿 天才
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.10,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你要去医学系对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:25.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,有考上的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.81,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,一定会上啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.44,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,轻轻松松啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.03,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:32.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,下次也教我数学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:35.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那就教我英文之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:37.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:40.20,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,下次模拟考稳啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,想得美咧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:44.33,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,-拜拜\N-拜啦 佐藤同学
